{
  "an8.42:0.1": "Numbered Discourses 8.42 ",
  "an8.42:0.2": "5. Sabbath ",
  "an8.42:0.3": "The Sabbath With Eight Factors, In Detail ",
  "an8.42:1.1": "“Mendicants, the observance of the sabbath with its eight factors is very fruitful and beneficial and brilliant and bountiful. ",
  "an8.42:1.2": "And how should it be observed? ",
  "an8.42:1.3": "It’s when a noble disciple reflects: ",
  "an8.42:1.4": "‘As long as they live, the perfected ones give up killing living creatures, renouncing the rod and the sword. They are scrupulous and kind, and live full of sympathy for all living beings. ",
  "an8.42:1.5": "I, too, for this day and night will give up killing living creatures, renouncing the rod and the sword. I’ll be scrupulous and kind, and live full of sympathy for all living beings. ",
  "an8.42:1.6": "I will observe the sabbath by doing as the perfected ones do in this respect.’ ",
  "an8.42:1.7": "This is its first factor. … ",
  "an8.42:2.1": "‘As long as they live, the perfected ones give up high and luxurious beds. They sleep in a low place, either a cot or a grass mat. ",
  "an8.42:2.2": "I, too, for this day and night will give up high and luxurious beds. I’ll sleep in a low place, either a cot or a grass mat. ",
  "an8.42:2.3": "I will observe the sabbath by doing as the perfected ones do in this respect.’ ",
  "an8.42:2.4": "This is its eighth factor. ",
  "an8.42:2.5": "The observance of the sabbath with its eight factors in this way is very fruitful and beneficial and brill